    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atalia eting’ana y’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 22:10—23:15)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ekero Atalia, ng’ina Ahasia, aroche ng’a omwana oye okuure akaimoka, agaita eamate yonsi y’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yehoseba, mosubati o Yehoramu omorwoti, omosubati omwabo Ahasia, akaira Yoashi, mosinto bw’Ahasia, bobisi korwa ase egati y’abana b’omorwoti, baria baarenge ang’e goitwa. Omoiseke oria akamobeka amo nomoreri oye ase akanyomba g’okorara. Ase enchera eye akabisa Yoashi ng’a Atalia tamoita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yoashi akaba okomenya amo na Yehoseba ase enyomba y’Omonene, ase abisetwe ase engaki y’emiaka etano nomo, ekero Atalia agendererete kogaambera ense eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o gatano na kabere, Yehoyada agatoma amang’ana korenta abatang’ani b’abarendi amagana b’omorwoti, na ab’enyomba y’omorwoti, akabairana ase enyomba y’Omonene, agakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania nabarabwo, na akagera bakaria chimuma agwo ase enyomba y’Omonene. Erio akaborokia omwana oria bw’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabachika, akabora: “Eke nakio egento morakore: Ensemo eyemo ya isato yaino, baria bakorenda ase rituko ri’Esabato, barende enyomba y’Omorwoti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ensemo ende ya isato barende ase Egeita gia Suri, na ensemo ende ya isato barende ase egeita magega y’abarendi. Naboigo mobe mokorenda ase enyomba y’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiombe bibere biaino biria bire ne ribaga ase rituko ri’Esabato, nigo birabe bikorenda enyomba y’Omonene ase omorwoti are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moetanane omorwoti chinsemo chionsi, kera oyomo abwate ebirwanero biaye koboko, na omonto onde bwensi oraike ang’e ase abarendi goika aitwe akwe. Mobe amo nomorwoti aase ande onsi akogenda na koirana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatang’ani baria b’abarendi amagana bagakora onsi koreng’ana buna Yehoyada Omokuani abachiigete. Kera oyomo akarenta abanto baye, baria baarenge gokora emeremo ase rituko ri’Esabato na baria baarenge korua ase emeremo ase rituko erio. Igo bakagenda ase Yehoyada Omokuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani akaa abatang’ani baria amatimo ne chinguba chiria chiarenge echi’omorwoti Daudi; ebinto ebio biarenge ime ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abarendi baria bagatenena korwa ensemo ya Irianyi y’enyomba goika ensemo ya sugusu, bagaetanana omorwoti ang’e negesasiimero na enyomba yonsi; kera oyomo obo obwate ebirwanero koboko kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yehoyada akarenta omwana oria omomura bw’omorwoti isiko, akamobekera egutwa ase omotwe oye, naende akamoa Egetabu ki’borori. Erio Yoashi akararigwa ng’a obeire omorwoti, na agaakwa amaguta. Abanto bagaaka chinkobi, bagateeba: “Omorwoti ochie kare!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Atalia aigwete amariogi ’abarendi na ay’abaanto bonsi, agasoa enyomba y’Omonene ase abanto basangererekanete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia akarora omorwoti oteneine ang’e nesiiro buna engencho yarenge. Abatang’ani na abanto abaarenge kobugia ebitureeri bateneine mbarabare y’omorwoti, na abanto bonsi b’ense eria nigo baarenge nomochengo, bakobugia ebitureeri. Atalia agatandora chianga chiaye, akarera, “Oko nokoregwa! Nokoregwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada Omokuani agachiika abatang’ani b’abasikari amagana, akabateebia, “Mosokie isiko, momobeke ase egati y’abarendi, na momoite n’omoro onde bwensi okomotunyana.” Omokuani tanchete omokungu oria aiterwe ime ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio bakabwata omokungu oria, bakamoetia ase egeita chibarasi chiarenge gosoera gochia ase enyomba y’omorwoti, bakamoitera aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoonchoreria kwa Yehoyada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 23:16-21)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada agakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania egati y’Omonene na omorwoti amo nabaanto, ng’a barabwo babe abanto ba Omonene; boigo agakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania egati y’omorwoti na abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bonsi b’ense eria bakagenda ase enyomba ya Baali, bakayetagora bakayeiyeria inse; ebisasimero biaye na emegwekano yaye agosasiima bakabinachana ebing’ese, bagaita Matani, Omokuani o Baali, agwo bosio bw’ebisasimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Na Yehoyada Omokuani akabeeka abarendi barende enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio akaira abatang’ani baria b’amagana, na abarendi b’omorwoti, na abarendi b’enyomba y’omorwoti, na abanto bonsi b’ense eria, na barabwo bakarusia omorwoti korwa ase enyomba y’Omonene, bakamoetia ase Egeita ki’Abarendi gochia ase enyomba y’omorwoti. Erio omorwoti agaikaransa ase ekerogo ki’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi b’ense eria bakaba nomochengo; na omochie okaba omotoereru, ekiagera Atalia aitirwe n’omoro, agwo ase enyomba y’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi nigo arenge nemiaka etano na ebere ekero achagete kogamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
